2026-07-27T08:53:28.6530677Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6531484Z i /tmp/RtmpAsmxS0/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6532008Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6532655Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6533590Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6534718Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6535994Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6536985Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6783114Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:53:28.6890735Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:53:28.7315505Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:53:28.7467600Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
